# Velora forms

- Reuse shared form components from the existing design system; do not invent one-off form fields.
- Keep existing colour tokens (CSS variables / theme tokens). Do not introduce new raw hex colours.
- Link helper text to inputs for screen readers (aria-describedby / FormDescription).
